; The playable scene. Sky, sun, ground, a spawn point and a HUD — the stack itself is generated
; from data/levels/*.json by chimney.gd, because rule 3 says no hand-placed level geometry.
;
; Hand-written text, reviewable in a diff. That is why we are in this engine.

